    "Compara o planejado com o feito (aderência, esforço, ritmo) e propõe ajustes para as próximas semanas. Usa o Sonnet; cada revisão custa centavos.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compares what was planned with what was done (adherence, effort, pace) and proposes adjustments for the coming weeks. Uses Sonnet; each review costs cents."
          }
        }
      }
    },
